{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1baf2d4aba97965e41fdbc734eeec7f2.avif?t=1773060490\" width=1560 height=1238 /></span><strong>Defeat the Metal Menace and protect your friends as you retake your home from the Smart Devices!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1664107efe49adc0c4ae2b4fc509e750.avif?t=1773060490\" alt=\"Become the Incredibug\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras_big/1664107efe49adc0c4ae2b4fc509e750.webp?t=1773060490 width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/47ce1cee8cf1815a023f0e06839dfe6a.poster.avif?t=1773060490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/47ce1cee8cf1815a023f0e06839dfe6a.webm?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/47ce1cee8cf1815a023f0e06839dfe6a.mp4?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pillbug Platforming with Bojo \u2013 <strong>Roll, Climb, Bounce,</strong> and learn the tricks of local insects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashy Firefly Coop</strong>: Join the adventure as Lumi the firefly with deep coop interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find secrets in the <strong>tiny world of insects</strong> on your journey to <strong>unite the critters.#</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibug is a <strong>colorful 3D platformer</strong> that combines fun platforming mechanics and heroic moments with a heartwarming story about friendship, teamwork, and the clash between nature and technology. Join Bojo, the pill bug who rises as a hero to <strong>defend the local critter community when their home is threatened by an AI-powered Smart Home system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Lumi the firefly and Ronald Roach, you will explore various environments \u2013 inside the <strong>tech-infested house, the garden, and underground</strong> \u2013 solving puzzles and battling robotic enemies while exploring nature and the human world from a new perspective. As you befriend unique bug allies, they'll teach you new tricks, and you'll travel the world like a true superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.avif?t=1773060490\" alt=\"The Power of Friendship\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras_big/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.webp?t=1773060490 width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.poster.avif?t=1773060490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.webm?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.mp4?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fusion Coop \u2013 More than a Sidekick!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and let them play as Lumi the firefly and use her abilities to support Bojo in an <strong>accessible coop mode</strong> that rewards teamwork with unique and powerful mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lumi's tricks with Bojo's and experiment with <strong>powerful interactions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amplify Bojo's abilities and boost his speed in any situation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Pester enemies (or your friend) and distract the cleaning robots to protect your friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Not just a Sidekick \u2013 Only together will you succeed! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally the Critters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you'll make plenty of friends on your journey, you can collect their entries in your <strong>friendship journal</strong> and they'll teach you their tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a06ea34920a588d9d847130c41300a88.poster.avif?t=1773060490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a06ea34920a588d9d847130c41300a88.webm?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a06ea34920a588d9d847130c41300a88.mp4?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow up Dungbeetle-crafted <strong>bombs</strong> and boost Bojo to new heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Swing through the world with a <strong>Grappling-Hook</strong> made of flexible spider silk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blind the minions of the metal menace using Lumi's <strong>firefly abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charge yourself with electricity to <strong>defy gravity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development of this game's concept was funded by &quot;FilmFernsehFonds Bayern&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/c2ab957d994d91f7413421a60aab241e.avif?t=1773060490\" alt=\"\"width=552 height=140 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604920?t=1773060490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/26a60df8c9812e3c522e497e9ff624bdd77e05dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773060490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/201bac28c6e169dfcecb45b42f72d27e13933abd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773060490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/201bac28c6e169dfcecb45b42f72d27e13933abd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773060490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor