d heroic moments with a heartwarming story about friendship, teamwork, and the clash between nature and technology. Join Bojo, the pill bug who rises as a hero to <strong>defend the local critter community when their home is threatened by an AI-powered Smart Home system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Lumi the firefly and Ronald Roach, you will explore various environments \u2013 inside the <strong>tech-infested house, the garden, and underground</strong> \u2013 solving puzzles and battling robotic enemies while exploring nature and the human world from a new perspective. As you befriend unique bug allies, they'll teach you new tricks, and you'll travel the world like a true superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.avif?t=1773060490\" alt=\"The Power of Friendship\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras_big/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.webp?t=1773060490 width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.poster.avif?t=1773060490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.webm?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/53ad01fae7aa3c2f403f2c7d20d7a462.mp4?t=1773060490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fusion Coop \u2013 More than a Sidekick!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and let them play as Lumi the firefly and use her abili